      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WorkManager.Components.SourceCredentialResolver",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WorkManager.Components.SourceCredentialResolver.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Resolves the effective <xref href=\"System.Net.Http.Headers.AuthenticationHeaderValue\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for a\ncode source fetch (<code>WorkManager.FetchFromUrlAsync</code>) from a\nper-request <xref href=\"Virtufin.WorkManager.Protos.SourceCredential\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, replacing the former\n<code>RegistryAuthHandler</code> -- a <xref href=\"System.Net.Http.DelegatingHandler\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nregistered unconditionally on the <code>CodeFetcher</code>\n<xref href=\"System.Net.Http.IHttpClientFactory\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> client and applied to every request\nwhose host matched, regardless of whether the caller actually wanted\nthe org credential used. Credentials are now explicit and per-request:\na directly-supplied Basic/Bearer secret, or a <code>named</code> reference\nresolved server-side (see <xref href=\"Virtufin.WorkManager.Components.SourceCredentialResolver.ResolveNamed(System.String%2cSystem.String%2cSystem.String%40)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>) so that secret\nnever has to be distributed to callers.</p>\n"
    },
