      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WorkManager.Services.WorkerProcessingRetryPipeline",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WorkManager.Services.WorkerProcessingRetryPipeline.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Polly-based retry pipeline for worker business-logic processing\nfailures, as distinct from <xref href=\"Virtufin.WorkManager.Services.DaprResiliencePipeline\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (which\nwraps Dapr/Gateway infra calls). Exhausting all attempts lets the\ncaller's exception propagate so it can dead-letter the message -- see\n<xref href=\"Virtufin.WorkManager.Configuration.WorkerProcessingRetryOptions\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for why this exists as its\nown pipeline.</p>\n"
    },
